# ===== Unlayered fork additions =====

# Build output and live printer configuration that earlier history committed into
# the firmware source tree (14 MB of .bin/.uf2/.elf plus 39 printer config files,
# including duplicates like "Duet3Firmware_Mini5plus - Copy.uf2" and
# "config - Copy (2).g"). Untracked with "git rm --cached", so the files remain on
# disk. Printer configs were snapshotted to ../backups/sys-snapshot-2026-07-25-pre-untrack.
# Flashable output for each board is produced in that board's build directory
# (e.g. Duet3Mini5plus/), which is already ignored above.
/firmware/
/sys/

# Editor and indexer artifacts. These previously lived only in .git/info/exclude,
# which is per-clone and therefore invisible to anyone else working on this fork.
compile_commands.json
.cache/
*.su

# Claude Code project-local settings (personal, machine-specific)
/.claude/

# python3 shim used by the UF2 build step where only python.exe is on PATH
/Tools/CrcAppender/win-x86-64/python3
